<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins unevenly steady; butts mostly steady; skinned hams 17-20 lbs $1.00-3.00 higher, 20-26 lbs 2.00-4.00 lower; seedless bellies steady to 1.00 higher; lean trimmings steady.</p>
<p>Trading moderate, with moderate demand and mostly moderate.</p>
<p>- USDA</p>
